                "answer": "Yes \u2014 NEOM, Red Sea Project, Qiddiyah, King Salman Energy Park (SPARK), and Diriyah Gate development projects all require precision forged components for construction equipment, permanent infrastructure, and facility mechanical systems. We supply through EPC contractors and Tier 2 suppliers managing project procurement. Project forgings: typically ASME B16.5 flanges, structural alloy forgings, and stainless SS 316L for coastal/marine service applications. Contact us with your project specification for a USD CIF Jeddah/Dammam quotation."
