                "answer": "Yes. For BMW, Mercedes-Benz, VW, Audi, Porsche (all IATF 16949 certified supply chains): crankshaft rough forgings in DIN EN 10083-3 42CrMo4 (1.7225), connecting rod blanks in 36MnVS4 (microalloyed), gearbox hub forgings in 18CrNiMo7-6 (1.6587, carburized). EN 10204 3.1 material certificates quoting DIN designation, IATF 16949:2016 certification, PPAP Level 3. CIF Hamburg 12\u201315 days from Mundra."
