                "question": "Can you supply PED 2014/68/EU Category IV forgings for BASF Ludwigshafen?",
                "answer": "Yes. For BASF's chemical plant pressure vessels (Category IV \u2014 highest risk): ammonia synthesis converter nozzle forgings in SA182 F22 (150 bar, 450\u00b0C), MDI reactor nozzle forgings in A182 F316L (phosgene service), and carbamate condenser nozzle forgings in 316L UG (urea service). PED Module D1 with T\u00dcV Rheinland NB 0035 CE marking, EN 10204 3.2 third-party inspection."
