        "description2": "Most forging suppliers hand over a bag of shot-blasted forgings and call it done. JK Forge goes further. Our integrated facility covers the complete supply chain from raw billet to a machined, heat-treated, inspected and documented component \u2014 arriving at your dock ready for assembly or further processing. That consolidation cuts your supplier count, reduces freight moves, and gives you a single point of accountability.",
