                "question": "What documentation do you provide with forging supplies?",
                "answer": "Standard documentation includes material test certificate (MTC) from NABL-accredited lab, certificate of conformance (CoC), dimensional inspection report and packing list. For export shipments, we add commercial invoice, country of origin certificate and HS code declaration. PPAP documentation is available for automotive customers."
