                "answer": "Yes. We prepare PPAP Level 3 packages including dimensional layouts (100% balloon inspection), material performance test reports, initial process capability studies (Cpk \u2265 1.33), control plans, process FMEA, MSA studies and PSW. We have supplied PPAP packages to customers in the Hero, Bajaj, Mahindra and Tata supply chains."
