                "answer": "Yes. We export regularly to Germany, UAE, USA, UK, Australia, South Africa, New Zealand, Singapore and Southeast Asia. Export shipments include full customs documentation, sea-worthy packing, and EN 10204 Type 3.1 or 3.2 material certificates as required by the importing country and end customer."
