        "description1": "JK Forge, based at Shapar, Rajkot, Gujarat, supplies precision hot-forged components to automotive OEMs, Tier 1 suppliers and engineering contractors in Pune and the surrounding Chakan, Pimpri-Chinchwad and Talegaon industrial belt. Distance: ~650 km, road freight in 12\u201314 hours. We supply forged parts for Tata, Mahindra, Bajaj, Force Motors, Volkswagen, Mercedes-Benz and their supply chains \u2014 at quality matching Tier 1 requirements and pricing that beats local Pune forging suppliers.",
        "description2": "Pune's automotive cluster is one of India's most demanding procurement environments. OEMs at Chakan and Pimpri-Chinchwad expect Tier 1-grade quality documentation, PPAP compliance, and delivery reliability measured in hours \u2014 not days. JK Forge has been meeting these expectations for customers in and around Pune for over a decade, despite being 650 km away. The explanation is simple: good logistics, better quality, and competitive total cost.",
