                "title": "Currency & Payment Flexibility",
                "desc": "We transact export orders in USD, EUR and GBP. Payment terms include T/T advance, 30% advance / 70% against BL copy and LC at sight. For established customers with volume orders, net-30 open account terms are considered. ECGC credit limit facility provides payment security for both parties. SWIFT payment confirmation is processed within 24 hours of receipt."
