            {
                "question": "Do UKCA marking requirements affect forging supply?",
                "answer": "UKCA marking responsibility rests with the UK economic operator (machinery manufacturer, pressure vessel fabricator) who places the product on the UK market \u2014 not with the forging supplier. JK Forge supplies conforming forged components with EN 10204 3.1 and EN 10228 documentation that feeds the UK manufacturer's UKCA technical file. For pressure equipment specifically, the UK PSSR (Pressure Systems Safety Regulations) is the relevant UK standard \u2014 documentation requirements are similar to EU PED."
            }
