        "description1": "JK Forge exports API 6A, NACE MR0175, and ASME SA-182 certified precision hot forgings to Oman \u2014 serving PDO (Petroleum Development Oman), OQ (formerly OmanOil/ORPIC), BP Oman, Oman LNG, and Sohar Industrial Port supply chains. CIF Muscat / CIF Sohar. 5\u20138 days ocean transit \u2014 world's fastest sea route from India. 35\u201340% below European supplier prices.",
