                "question": "What automobile forging components does JK Forge manufacture?",
                "answer": "JK Forge manufactures steering knuckles, wheel hubs, brake drums, axle half shafts, connecting rods, crankshaft forgings, suspension arms, brake cams, engine crankwebs, fork yokes, and differential components for 2-wheeler, 3-wheeler, passenger car, and commercial vehicle OEMs."
